          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ট্রান্সফার করা (ṭrānsphār kôrā) joins transfer, borrowed from English, to করা, to do, the usual way Bengali makes a verb of an English word."
